# Raw photo libraries staged in public/ (677 MB as of Aug 2026).
#
# These must NOT be committed. Anything in public/ is copied verbatim into
# dist/, so committing them would (a) push the repo past GitHub's comfortable
# size, (b) make every clone painfully slow, and (c) be permanent — git history
# cannot be cleaned without a force-rewrite that breaks everyone else's clone.
#
# The workflow is the one used for the Dr Wakil hero: optimise the single image
# you need into public/images/ (5.5 MB -> 202 KB) and commit only that.
public/Clinic/
public/Logos/
public/Signature file/
public/DR SW photos -*/
public/DR SW WS photos -*/
public/Animation -*/
public/*.docx
